<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xri version="1.0">
   <description>
      <p>
        TGScripts - PixInsight scripts provided by Thorsten Glebe.
     </p>
   </description>
   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.6:1.9.99">
      <package fileName="TGScripts_repository.tar.gz" sha1="0a35a1cc9bcc8d650069382f5d260c70239b9612" type="script" releaseDate="20261110">
         <title>
            TGScripts - renamed tools and maintenance fixes
         </title>
         <remove>
            src/scripts/TGScripts
            doc/scripts/AberrationInspectorTG
            doc/scripts/AberrationSpotterTG
            doc/scripts/AstroBucketList
            doc/scripts/BBStarReduction
            doc/scripts/ColorMaskTG
            doc/scripts/CSTG
            doc/scripts/DarkStructureEnhanceTG
            doc/scripts/DeconvolutionPreviewTG
            doc/scripts/LinearMasterBlend
            doc/scripts/LocalSupportMask
            doc/scripts/LRGBDeconvolutionMatch
            doc/scripts/ROILinearFit
            doc/scripts/StarSpikeProtectionMask
            doc/scripts/SubframeQualityReview
            doc/scripts/TGScriptSkeleton
            doc/scripts/EmissionLineIntegrationTG
            doc/scripts/TGFieldMosaic
            doc/scripts/TGCornerMosaic
            doc/scripts/TGHueRangeMask
            doc/scripts/TGDustContrast
            doc/scripts/TGPSFComparison
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
               Image processing, imaging-target planning and subframe review tools for PixInsight. This package requires PixInsight 1.9.6 or later.
            </p>
            <p>
               New script names: AberrationInspectorTG is now TG Field Mosaic 2.3.0; AberrationSpotterTG is now TG Corner Mosaic 2.3.0; ColorMaskTG is now TG Hue Range Mask 2.3.0; DarkStructureEnhanceTG is now TG Dust Contrast 2.5.0; DeconvolutionPreviewTG is now TG PSF Comparison 2.4.0.
               Menu entries, filenames and help guides use the new names. Recreate saved process icons that reference the former script filenames.
            </p>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List 0.35.1: Network requests to SIMBAD and DSS now identify PixInsight followed by the script name and version. Documented network connections, temporary files and recovery storage. Retains the recent SOL import fix that excludes metadata from unselected source lists.
            </p>
            <p>
               Subframe Quality Review 0.55.2: Documented the launch of the installed PixInsight executable with --yield to load a reviewed WBPP process icon into the current instance. Added details about temporary files and move/undo journals. WBPP processing still requires the user&apos;s explicit action.
            </p>
            <p>
               Regenerated the updated user guides and removed an unused continuum-subtraction helper containing obsolete temporary-executable handling. The package deploys only TGScripts code, signatures and compiled script documentation in their designated directories.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
</xri>
